"entity": {
"name": "Gen Digital Inc.",
"description": "Gen Digital, Inc. engages in the provision of security, storage, and systems management solutions. It focuses on providing consumer cyber safety with its business solutions. Its brands include Norton, Avast, Lifelock, Avira, AVG, and CCleaner. The company operates through the Cyber Safety Platform and Trust-Based Solutions segments. The Cyber Safety Platform segment engages in providing security, privacy, and comprehensive digital protection solutions that help users navigate the digital world safely and confidently. The Trust-Based Solutions segment engages in providing identity, reputation, and financial wellness solutions that help consumers manage their identity, reputation, and finances with confidence. Gen Digital was founded by Gary Hendrix in April 1982 and is headquartered in Tempe, AZ.",
